      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, that\u0027s the problem -- the outside halves of the channels get dropped when `LocalTa` is dropped, and that makes the corresponding inside halves (running in the separate thread) report an error on [`send`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/sync/mpsc/struct.Sender.html#method.send) / [`recv`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/std/sync/mpsc/struct.Receiver.html#method.recv).  So when the latter happens, we\u0027ll now just terminate the separate thread, and can restart with a new `LocalTa` and inner thread for the next test.",
